  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Program f&#xF6;r utveckling av system f&#xF6;r socialt arbete i St Petersburg genom Stockholms Universitet (Inst.f&#xF6;r Socialt arbete) och Stockholms stad. Seminarieverksamhet, studiebes&#xF6;k och en konferens i St Petersburg kommer bla att behandla reformering, lagstiftningsfr&#xE5;gor och databaser f&#xF6;r dokumentation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme supporting development in the social sector in St  Petersburg is carried out by the Stockholm University Department of Social Work and the City of Stockholm. Seminars, studytours and a conference in St Petersburg, will focus on legislation, target social security systems and databases for documentation.</narrative>
